WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.376 --> 00:00:03.926
Unit eighteen. Public Health Policy!

2
00:00:04.908 --> 00:00:13.510
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Upper-Intermediate level!

3
00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.578
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.628 --> 00:00:22.038
Today we learn: Public Health Policy. Let's go!

5
00:00:23.194 --> 00:00:28.527
Public health policy. Say it with me. Public health policy!

6
00:00:32.025 --> 00:00:37.075
Healthcare access. Say it with me. Healthcare access!

7
00:00:40.571 --> 00:00:45.121
Preventive care. Say it with me. Preventive care!

8
00:00:48.645 --> 00:00:52.712
Epidemic. Say it with me. Epidemic!

9
00:00:56.195 --> 00:01:00.662
Vaccination. Say it with me. Vaccination!

10
00:01:04.157 --> 00:01:08.974
Health disparity. Say it with me. Health disparity!

11
00:01:12.538 --> 00:01:17.005
Government funding. Say it with me. Government funding!

12
00:01:20.465 --> 00:01:24.482
Wellbeing. Say it with me. Wellbeing!

13
00:01:27.948 --> 00:01:37.499
Grammar time! Passive voice for policy. Listen. Vaccination programs are funded by the government.

14
00:01:37.549 --> 00:01:43.633
Your turn. Say it with me. Vaccination programs are funded by the government.

15
00:01:48.972 --> 00:02:07.060
Effective public health policy focuses on expanding healthcare access and preventive care to reduce disease and health disparity. Government funding for vaccination programs plays a critical role during an epidemic, protecting overall community wellbeing.

16
00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:08.733
I like this story!

17
00:02:09.775 --> 00:02:14.867
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:14.917 --> 00:02:16.287
Preventive care!

19
00:02:17.428 --> 00:02:22.702
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:22.752 --> 00:02:24.351
Government funding!

21
00:02:25.229 --> 00:02:34.072
Think and answer. What public health issue do you think deserves more funding?

22
00:02:34.122 --> 00:02:35.272
Great answer!

23
00:02:36.406 --> 00:02:39.747
This unit's value is Public Responsibility.

24
00:02:39.797 --> 00:02:42.880
I can show public responsibility every day!

25
00:02:43.648 --> 00:02:48.184
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:49.858
Goodbye, everyone!

